silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_04_limits_and_colimits_sections_06_equalizer_concrete_anchor_3_BodyMassMeasurement99#bodymassmeasurement99 silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassMeasurement99 is the measurement event: Mittens weighed 4.2 kg by Dr. Osei on 2026-05-18 using a clinical scale. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BodyMassMeasurement99', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
